# Models an agent harness runs against, each with the context window it needs.
#
# Format: <model> <context tokens>, one per line. Blank lines and anything after
# a '#' are ignored.
#
# sync-models.sh pulls each model and creates "<model>-<N>k": the same weights
# with num_ctx set, so no second download. An agent's tools need a context of
# 64k or more, and ollama gives a model 4k by default on a card under 24 GiB.
# The gateway's local/agent entry (stack/observability/litellm/config.yaml)
# names one of these variants.
#
# Context takes GPU memory. On a 16 GB card, check with `ollama ps` that the
# variant still loads wholly on the GPU: a model that spills onto the CPU
# drops to a few tokens a second.

ornith-1.5:9b   65536   # 6.6 GB download; 7.7 GB on the GPU at 64k (RTX 5080, 2026-11-26)
